# Windsurf rules — autoresearch

This repo uses a portable `.agent/` brain. Load it at session start:

- `.agent/AGENTS.md` — map of the brain.
- `.agent/memory/personal/PREFERENCES.md` — stable user conventions.
- `.agent/memory/semantic/LESSONS.md` — distilled patterns.
- `.agent/skills/_index.md` — skills. Load full `SKILL.md` only when triggers match.
- `.agent/protocols/permissions.md` — check before any tool call.

Directive: see `program.md`.

Key constraints (full list in permissions.md):
- Never edit `prepare.py` — it's the eval harness.
- Never add dependencies. Use only what's in `pyproject.toml`.
- Never commit `results.tsv` — it stays untracked.
- Never stop the experiment loop unless explicitly interrupted.
- Each experiment iteration runs in a fresh-context subagent.
